OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,FA council is consulting on plans which
OL,7,Fcould stop people standing in central
OL,8,FLondon bars as it tries to curb
OL,9,F"excessive drunkenness".
OL,11,FWestminster Council has come under
OL,12,Ffire from businesses and the Mayor of
OL,13,FLondon Sir Sadiq Khan about the
OL,14,Flicensing policy which wants to remove
OL,15,F"vertical drinking" and encourage
OL,16,Ftable service in Soho and the West End.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@WO]wD@AOUwD@SO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,FThe policy says the Council wants to
OL,7,F"discourage excessive drunkenness and
OL,8,Fencourage the provision of more
OL,9,Fseating in premises that serve alcohol
OL,10,Ffor people to sit and enjoy a drink
OL,11,Fand order food by table service in
OL,12,Fplace of open bar space that caters
OL,13,Ffor high volume vertical drinking".
OL,15,FLesley Lewis, the owner of Soho's
OL,16,Ffamous French House pub and dining
OL,17,Froom, said it could lead to closures,
OL,18,Fredundancies and loss of business.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@bO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,FMs Lewis, 71, who has owned the
OL,7,Fbusiness for 37 years, said the
OL,8,Fpolicy, if implemented, "will kill the
OL,9,Fwhole business".
OL,11,FShe said: "It will really finish us
OL,12,Foff.
OL,14,F"We rely on those people standing up
OL,15,Fwith the rents and the rates put upon
OL,16,Fus.
OL,26,@pD@YOUqD@OO]sD@KOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,F"People want to enjoy themselves in
OL,7,FSoho, they want to have a drink
OL,8,Foutside, they want to dance, they
OL,9,Fdon't want to sit down and just be
OL,10,Fwhere they are, they want to meet
OL,11,Fpeople and chat.
OL,13,F"People will go to other places like
OL,14,FCamden Town that are a bit more
OL,15,Fexciting and a bit more license
OL,16,Ffriendly.
OL,18,FWhen asked what effect the potential
OL,19,Fchanges could have, Ms Lewis added: "I
OL,20,Fdon't think people will come to Soho
OL,21,Fif it's that sanitised, it'll kill it.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU{D@eOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,F"It's always had that little bit of
OL,7,Fnaughtiness.
OL,9,F"Our restaurant might survive, but the
OL,10,Fbar supports the restaurant.
OL,12,F"I know a lot of people will be made
OL,13,Fredundant.
OL,15,F"I'm sure it's the same across the
OL,16,Fboard for anybody like us.
OL,18,F"We shall have to fight it on all
OL,19,Ffronts."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUtD@AOUwD@AOUzD@AOU{D@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,FSir Sadiq is set to gain new powers
OL,7,Fthat will allow him to "call-in and
OL,8,Famend certain decisions", according to
OL,9,Fthe draft policy.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the mayor said the
OL,12,Fdraft policy highlighted the new
OL,13,Fpowers' importance.
OL,15,FThey said: "This is more evidence that
OL,16,Frestrictive and anti-growth policies
OL,17,Faren't working.
OL,19,F"At a time when venues need our
OL,20,Fsupport more than ever, the rules on
OL,21,Flicensing are stacked against them.
OL,26,@oD@XOUpD@XO]wD@LOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,F"The new powers mean the Mayor will be
OL,7,Fable to call in licensing decisions
OL,8,Fand have a say in local policies to
OL,9,Fprotect London's vital nightlife and
OL,10,Fhospitality industries."
OL,12,FThe Council's existing policy is that
OL,13,Fthere is a "presumption to normally
OL,14,Frefuse applications for pubs, bars,
OL,15,Ffast food premises and music, dance or
OL,16,Fsimilar entertainment venues in the
OL,17,FWest End Cumulative Impact Zone, other
OL,18,Fthan in limited circumstances".
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@XO]uD@LOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,FTo explain the strategy behind the
OL,7,Fdraft policy, the council said it
OL,8,Fwishes to "promote a more balanced
OL,9,Frange of venues that are less
OL,10,Fdominated by alcohol-led activities".
OL,12,FDefending the draft policy,
OL,13,FConservative councillor Timothy Barnes
OL,14,Fposted on X: "Our guidance is simply
OL,15,Fabout encouraging venues to manage
OL,16,Ftheir customers so people don't pack
OL,17,Fonto pavements or excessive drinking
OL,18,Fdoesn't disturb others passing by."
OL,26,@pD@KOUrD@dO]vD@NOUzD@cO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,FHe added: "We are the country's
OL,7,Flargest planning authority with some
OL,8,F4,000 licensed venues.
OL,10,F"We reject less than 1.5% of licence
OL,11,Fapplications and there is a strong
OL,12,Fdesire to see thriving, profitable,
OL,13,Fvenues across Westminster.
OL,15,F"As we have made clear we are happy to
OL,16,Fwork with the Mayor of London on
OL,17,Flicensing and have just launched our
OL,18,Fown campaign to promote nights out in
OL,19,FSoho."
OL,26,@nD@KOUrD@AOUwD@AOU{D@FO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,FIn response to the draft policy, a
OL,7,Fspokesperson for the Soho Business
OL,8,FAlliance told the Press Association:
OL,9,F"I think they're trying to reduce the
OL,10,Fcapacities in these venues.
OL,12,F"It's been like that for years where
OL,13,Fpeople are standing and drinking, it's
OL,14,Fnot causing crime, it's not causing
OL,15,Fissues.
OL,17,F"It's them trying to change the nature
OL,18,Fof Soho and it's quite sad that
OL,19,Fthey've gone to such lengths to
OL,20,Fsanitise the area.
OL,26,@qD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786202287
OL,3,CCouncil in central London considering
OL,4,Ccurbs on 'vertical drinking'
OL,6,F"They don't want the late-night
OL,7,Feconomy.
OL,9,F"This policy completely contradicts
OL,10,Fthe Mayor of London's London plan."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUrD@cO]
